### login correto
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "diego", "senha": "1234" }

### perfil com a sessao
GET http://localhost:3000/perfil

### senha errada
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "diego", "senha": "errada" }

### usuario inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "nao-existe", "senha": "1234" }

### logout
POST http://localhost:3000/logout

### perfil depois do logout
GET http://localhost:3000/perfil
